 align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">F fetus bw (g)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.97 &#x000b1; 0.03</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.14 &#x000b1; 0.03<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn12-ehp0115-000541">**</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">M fetus bw (g)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.00 &#x000b1; 0.03</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.19 &#x000b1; 0.03<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn12-ehp0115-000541">**</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">F + M fetus bw (g)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.99 &#x000b1; 0.02</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.16 &#x000b1; 0.02<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn12-ehp0115-000541">**</xref></td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn10-ehp0115-000541"><p>Abbreviations: F, female; M, male. Data are presented as mean &#x000b1; SE; <italic>n</italic> = 7 litters for control, <italic>n</italic> = 8 litters for AMM.</p></fn><fn id="tfn11-ehp0115-000541"><label>a</label><p>No dead fetuses.</p></fn><fn id="tfn12-ehp0115-000541"><label>**</label><p><italic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.01 compared with controls.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="t4-ehp0115-000541" position="float"><label>Table 4</label><caption><p>Effects of AMM (mg/kg bw/day) on mammary gland scores.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">PND</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Control</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.09 AMM</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.87 AMM</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">8.73 AMM</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">ATR</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">3.27 &#x000b1; 0.28</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.52 &#x000b1; 0.18</td><td align="left" rowspan=